 "fn-95": "<a href=\"https://agritech.tnau.ac.in/animal_husbandry/animhus_cb_housing_space.html\"><code>tnau-cattle-housing</code></a> - 「3.5」 sq m covered and 「7.0」 sq m open per adult beast, with a manger 「60 – 75」 cm - the page's own space table for adult cattle, a modern standard",
